{"sections":[{"slug":"无穷小空间","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"无穷小空间"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">无穷小对象</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">综合微分几何</span>)"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"subject":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/综合微分几何","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">综合微分几何</span>"}}]},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"无穷小对象 (综合微分几何)"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/综合微分几何","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">综合微分几何</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">最基本的无穷小空间是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/直线(SDG)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">直线</span>"}},{"Plain":" $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/一阶无穷小线段","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">一阶无穷小线段</span>"}},{"Plain":" $D\\subset R$,\n$$\r\nD = \\{x\\in R : x^2=0\\}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">一般地</span>, $R^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的一阶无穷小对象</span> $D(n)\\subset R^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">定义为</span>\n$$\r\nD(n)=\\{(x_1,\\cdots,x_n)\\in R^n : \\forall i\\forall j, x_ix_j = 0\\}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">有包含关系</span> $D(n)\\subset D^n$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">阶无穷小对象</span>\n$$\r\nD_k(n) = \\{(x_1,\\cdots,x_n)\\in R^n: \\forall i_1 \\cdots \\forall i_{k+1},x_{i_1}\\cdots x_{i_{k+1}}=0 \\}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">则有</span> $\\{0\\} \\subset D(n)\\subset D_2(n)\\subset D_3(n)\\subset\\cdots$. <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>\n$$\r\nD_\\infty(n)=\\bigcup_k D_k(n).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $R$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $V$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>\n$$\r\nD_k(V)=\\{x\\in V: x^{\\otimes (k+1)}=0\\in V^{\\otimes (k+1)}\\}.\r\n$$</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">不过有一个细节没有想清楚</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $R$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $W$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及</span> $x\\in W$, <span lang=\"zh\">假设对任意</span> $R$-<span lang=\"zh\">模同态</span> $f\\colon W\\to R$ <span lang=\"zh\">有</span> $f(x)=0$, <span lang=\"zh\">是否可以推出</span> $x=0$.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p>$D_k(n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">在数乘下封闭</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">对</span> $x\\in D_k(n), \\lambda\\in R$ <span lang=\"zh\">有</span> $\\lambda x\\in D_k(n)$.</p>\n<p>$D_k(n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">在加法下一般不封闭</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但有</span> $D_k(n) + D_\\ell(n)\\subset D_{k+\\ell}(n)$. <span lang=\"zh\">因此</span>, $D_{\\infty}(n)$ <span lang=\"zh\">在加法下封闭</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}